import "res://assets/dialogue/dialogue_scripts/7d-Az-ConditionalConvo-CellarGeneral.dialogue" as ConditionalConvo


~ trap
Winston: Aha! There thou art, pint-size!
Fenn: Uh oh.
Az: cough You good?
Winston: Now, I has't been thinking. Thou hath been quite the thorn in mine own side, and I needeth a way to get rid of thee... 
Fenn: Okay...
Winston: And what better way... than with...
Winston: A GIANT ICY CAGE!!!!
As he says it, a large cage falls from the ceiling, directly on top of Fenn
=> END

~ escaped
Fenn escapes the trap with a quick leaf dash
Winston: Oh yeah. I- I forgot thee couldst do that. 
Az: HAH. Seriously?! That's literally Fenn's main trick. Nice job, wizard boy.
Winston: Arrrgh!
Fenn: That's okay. I sometimes forget about it too. It's not very helpful.
Winston: Waiteth what? Nay! It's really cool, I just...
Winston: I thought thee only hadst that curs'd bracelet from the scary lady
Az: I can hear you.
Fenn: It's a bangle, actually. And it's way cooler than my leaves.
Winston: Oh...
Winston: Anyways, I'm going to... um...
Winston: I'm going to go planneth thy downfall.
Winston leaves.
Az: What a weird dude.
Fenn: What do you mean?
Az: Nevermind.

